# A shell and an agent beside a note. Their programs are a made-up shell that plays a script (a headless render
# has no pty to wait on, and a real program's screen is never the same twice): run it with
# `--programs scenes/terminal.programs.json` after the second `--`. The note is `parts.seed.ts`'s.
bar.open scope=search query="Bed plan"
bar.pick n=1
terminal.open
tile.type text="seeds\n" tile=shell
tile.type text="beds --north" tile=shell
terminal.open agent=true command="seedbot --plan beds"
